WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.068
Mr. Wig came home from his morning walk.

2
00:00:16.069 --> 00:00:20.522
He went into his kitchen and poured some orange juice.

3
00:00:20.523 --> 00:00:23.372
Suddenly he heard sounds in his bedroom.

4
00:00:23.373 --> 00:00:28.018
Click, click, click. Buzz, buzz.

5
00:00:28.019 --> 00:00:33.908
"What is going on in there?" Mr. Wig wondered.

6
00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:37.684
He went into his bedroom and gasped.

7
00:00:37.685 --> 00:00:39.935
Spider webs were everywhere.

8
00:00:39.936 --> 00:00:43.884
The door to his safe was open, and the safe was empty.

9
00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:46.804
"Oh no!" cried Mr. Wig.

10
00:00:46.805 --> 00:00:51.487
"All my money is gone!"

11
00:00:51.488 --> 00:00:54.869
"No, thank you," said a woman.

12
00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:58.237
"I don't want to buy any candy bars."

13
00:00:58.238 --> 00:01:00.935
The woman shut the door.

14
00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:03.971
Roxy and her friends were selling candy bars.

15
00:01:03.972 --> 00:01:06.124
"Oh well," said Mara.

16
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:15.535
"Let's try the next house."

17
00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:19.681
They were raising money to help poor families in Metro City.

18
00:01:19.682 --> 00:01:23.201
The four friends arrived at the next house.

19
00:01:23.202 --> 00:01:27.099
Roxy knocked on the door.

20
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.768
An old man answered. "Yes?" he said.

21
00:01:30.769 --> 00:01:33.372
"Hello, sir!" said Roxy.

22
00:01:33.373 --> 00:01:36.618
"Would you like to buy a delicious candy bar?

23
00:01:36.619 --> 00:01:38.421
We have three kinds.

24
00:01:38.422 --> 00:01:40.547
All of the money will go to—"

25
00:01:40.548 --> 00:01:43.680
"Candy bars rot your teeth," the man said.

26
00:01:43.681 --> 00:01:45.737
"I never eat them."

27
00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:50.154
"But we're raising money to help poor families," said Mara.

28
00:01:50.155 --> 00:01:51.996
The man shook his head.

29
00:01:51.997 --> 00:01:53.983
"I'm not interested.

30
00:01:53.984 --> 00:01:55.935
And I'm very busy.

31
00:01:55.936 --> 00:02:00.191
Good-bye." He closed the door.

32
00:02:00.192 --> 00:02:06.671
"This stinks!" said Jack as they walked away from the house.

33
00:02:06.672 --> 00:02:10.100
"Nobody wants to buy any candy bars."

34
00:02:10.101 --> 00:02:12.160
"Don't worry," said Mara.

35
00:02:12.161 --> 00:02:15.592
"We just have to keep trying."

36
00:02:15.593 --> 00:02:19.456
"Maybe we should go to a different neighborhood," said Jack.

37
00:02:19.457 --> 00:02:22.935
"This is a rich neighborhood," said Roxy.

38
00:02:22.936 --> 00:02:26.538
"I'm sure someone here will buy some candy bars."

39
00:02:26.539 --> 00:02:28.781
Terrell's face lit up.

40
00:02:28.782 --> 00:02:31.435
"I have an idea," he said.

41
00:02:31.436 --> 00:02:35.409
"Let's ask Rocket Girl to help us sell the candy bars."

42
00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:37.577
Roxy laughed.

43
00:02:37.578 --> 00:02:39.970
"What can Rocket Girl do?

44
00:02:39.971 --> 00:02:43.073
She can't make people buy anything."

45
00:02:43.074 --> 00:02:46.972
"You're probably right." Terrell sighed.

46
00:02:46.973 --> 00:02:52.601
"Let's go to the next house."

47
00:02:52.602 --> 00:02:57.868
The four friends walked some more.

48
00:02:57.869 --> 00:03:02.882
When they reached the next house, Roxy's watch beeped.

49
00:03:02.883 --> 00:03:07.661
She stayed on the sidewalk as her friends went to the door.

50
00:03:07.662 --> 00:03:12.014
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy. "Is there a problem?"

51
00:03:12.015 --> 00:03:14.515
"Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

52
00:03:14.516 --> 00:03:17.404
"Do you know who Mr. Wig is?"

53
00:03:17.405 --> 00:03:19.899
"Of course," said Roxy.

54
00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:23.351
"He's one of the richest people in Metro City.

55
00:03:23.352 --> 00:03:26.175
I'm right near his house now, actually."

56
00:03:26.176 --> 00:03:28.588
"Good," said Mayor Bloom.

57
00:03:28.589 --> 00:03:33.306
"Someone just broke into his house and stole his money."

58
00:03:33.307 --> 00:03:36.243
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

59
00:03:36.244 --> 00:03:42.662
"Rocket Girl will find the thief!"

